satori-config (0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: X session, herbstluftwm autostart and keybindings,
    polybar and picom defaults, startx on tty1, helper scripts and
    satori-get-melia.
  * Security and privacy defaults (DEC-023): satori-firewall (nftables),
    Firefox ESR and Brave telemetry policies, Wi-Fi scan MAC randomisation.
  * pam-auth-update profile so a console login unlocks the GNOME keyring:
    Excalibur's libpam-gnome-keyring profile only handles password changes.

